#############################
### Empire Station Models ###
#############################


#	Model					Section								Built-In Locators

#	Empire Starbase L1		-	Outpost							-	Weapons
#	Empire Starbase L2		-	Starport						-	Weapons
#	Empire Starbase L3		-	Starhold						-	Weapons
#	Empire Starbase L4		-	Star Fortress						-	Weapons
#	Empire Starbase L5		-	Citadel + Solar Stronghold + Headquarters (Station)	-	Weapons
#	Valor Station L1		-	Habitat Phase 1 + Citadel Phase 1			-	n/a
#	Valor Station L2		-	Habitat Phase 2 + Citadel Phase 2			-	n/a
#	Valor Station L3		-	Habitat Phase 3 + Citadel Phase 3			-	n/a
#	Jovan Station			-	Headquarters (Megastructure)				-	Explosions (& Detonate)
#	Golan Space Defense Gun 1	-	Military Station Small					-	Weapons + Explosions
#	Golan Space Defense Gun II	-	Military Station Medium					-	Weapons + Explosions
#	Golan Space Defense Gun III	-	Military Station Large					-	Weapons + Explosions
#	Mining Station			-	Mining Station						-	n/a
#	Research Station		-	Research Station					-	n/a
#	Long Range Scanner		-	Observation Post					-	n/a
#	Laser Defense Satellite		-	Ion Cannon						-	Weapons
#	Hyperspace Beacon		-	Hyper Relay						-	Lights
#	Asteroid Mining Base		-	Asteroid Manufactory					-	Lights + Effects


